To patch at a left (number) by a top (number) with a width (number) over a height (number) as a shade (number) from an x (number) toward a y (number):
  Let the column be the x + the left.
  Let the vertical be the y + the top.
  Fill Screen from the column by the vertical with the width over the height as the shade.

To facecaterpie at an x (number) by a y (number):
  Patch at 12 by 13 with 20 over 19 as 3 from the x toward the y.
  Patch at 10 by 16 with 24 over 12 as 3 from the x toward the y.
  Patch at 14 by 15 with 16 over 15 as 1 from the x toward the y.
  Patch at 15 by 18 with 5 over 6 as 0 from the x toward the y.
  Patch at 17 by 19 with 2 over 4 as 3 from the x toward the y.
  Patch at 25 by 18 with 5 over 6 as 0 from the x toward the y.
  Patch at 26 by 19 with 2 over 4 as 3 from the x toward the y.
  Patch at 21 by 10 with 3 over 5 as 3 from the x toward the y.
  Patch at 17 by 7 with 3 over 5 as 3 from the x toward the y.
  Patch at 25 by 7 with 3 over 5 as 3 from the x toward the y.
  Patch at 20 by 30 with 18 over 12 as 3 from the x toward the y.
  Patch at 22 by 31 with 14 over 9 as 2 from the x toward the y.
  Patch at 33 by 32 with 11 over 9 as 3 from the x toward the y.
  Patch at 35 by 33 with 7 over 7 as 1 from the x toward the y.
  Patch at 17 by 39 with 6 over 4 as 3 from the x toward the y.
  Patch at 31 by 40 with 6 over 4 as 3 from the x toward the y.

