To portrait a species (text) at an x (number) by a y (number):
  Wildportrait the species at the x by the y.
  Depict the species at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Geodude":
    Illustrategeodude at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Onix":
    Illustrateonix at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Caterpie":
    facecaterpie at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Weedle":
    faceweedle at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Pidgey":
    facepidgey at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Rattata":
    facerattata at the x by the y.

  If the species is "Kakuna":
    Facekakuna at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Diglett":
    Facediglett at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Sandshrew":
    Facesandshrew at the x by the y.

To back a species (text) at an x (number) by a y (number):
  Wildback the species at the x by the y.
  Turn the species at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Caterpie" or the species is "Weedle" or the species is "Pidgey" or the species is "Rattata" or the species is "Kakuna" or the species is "Sandshrew" or the species is "Diglett":
    Portrait the species at the x by the y.
